rfc7914.txt
    Extracted by a script from sections 8 to 12 of RFC 7914, "The scrypt Password-Based Key Derivation Function",
    https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7914.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-24.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the vectors are data.
    Format: Key = Value records with the function (Salsa20/8, BlockMix, ROMix, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA-256, scrypt), its
    parameters and its input and output in hexadecimal (P and S are the ASCII strings in hexadecimal).
    Used: every record; the scrypt vector with N = 1048576 (1 GiB of memory) only when the tests are run with --ignored.
